(f) Whether the Grievance Redressal Committee in each district had been constituted?

29. In view of the above discussions, the following directions are issued:
(i) On or before 15th April 2022, the State shall pay Rs.50,000/- as ex gratia amount to the victims (if alive) and the next of kin of the victims who have died, on account of the Covid-19 disaster whose names have been mentioned in the report of Shri A.B.S.
Naidu, Retired District Judge;

